@startuml
skinparam shadowing false

participant Generator
participant "Очередь\n(Critical Section)" as Q
participant Semaphore as SEM
participant Worker as W
participant Collector

Generator -> Q : добавить заявку (HIGH/NORMAL)
Generator -> SEM : Release (+1)

W -> SEM : Wait
W -> Q : взять заявку (сначала HIGH)
W -> Collector : обработанная заявка
Collector -> Collector : лог и статистика
@enduml